 "intro_html": "Japanese rolled omelet, built from thin layers that are rolled up one after another. Yours is seasoned with <b>sake, mirin and brown sugar</b>, with <b>nori flakes</b> sprinkled on a middle layer so every slice shows a green swirl. Keep the heat moderate: the sugar browns quickly.",
