 "notes": [
  {
   "html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>The seasoning amounts are a starting point — your notes didn’t include quantities.</li><li>More sugar browns faster, so lower the heat if you sweeten it more.</li></ul>",
   "title_html": "Amounts"
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>A small round non-stick pan works; trim the rounded ends after rolling.</p>",
   "title_html": "No tamagoyaki pan?"
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>A spoon or two of <a href=\"niboshi-bonito-dashi.html\">dashi</a> makes it softer and juicier (dashimaki style); leave it out for a firmer, sweeter omelet.</p>",
   "title_html": "Dashi"
  }
